                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I am incredibly honored by the trust my colleagues have placed in me by selecting me as a member of the Ways and Means Committee for the 119th Congress.\n\nFrom tax policy to healthcare to trade matters, the Ways and Means Committee touches countless areas impacting East Texans and the First District of Texas.\n\nI look forward to the work ahead as we extend the Trump Tax Cuts, reignite our economy, and promote polices that benefit Texas families, taxpayers, and small businesses.",
