                "text": "Big news for TX-01: Smith County and the City of Tyler have been recognized as a Veteran-Friendly Community by the East Texas Council of Governments!\n\nThis incredible designation honors the community\u2019s efforts to support our veterans with resources in housing, healthcare, transportation, education, and more. Thank you to all who have worked to make this achievement possible. Let's continue supporting our heroes who have given so much for our freedom!  \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 https://t.co/KRPO03gLxd",
