                "text": "On the anniversary of the Dobbs decision, Texas continues to lead in protecting life and supporting mothers.\n\nThe \u201cTexas Thriving Families\u201d program is on track to help nearly 45,000 moms with housing, healthcare, and job training, backed by $15 million in state support.\n\nThis is what pro-life policy should look like. The result is hope and life.",
