                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 .@CMSGov reports 2.8\u202fmillion Americans double-enrolled in Medicaid/CHIP or ACA plans\u2014wasting an estimated $14\u202fbillion a year.\n\nThanks to the OBBB, @HouseGOP is cracking down on double-dipping and restoring integrity to programs meant for the truly vulnerable. \n\nMeanwhile, @HouseDemocrats are fighting tooth and nail to keep the waste, fraud, and abuse in place. \n\ud83d\udd17 https://t.co/dBmOIM3eb2",
