                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Democrats are threatening to shut down the government unless Republicans agree to pour billions more into Obamacare subsidies\u2014taxpayer dollars that prop up rising insurance costs and mainly benefit insurance companies, not families. These subsidies are set to expire at the end of 2025 because Democrats wrote that expiration into law. Now they want to pretend otherwise and are willing to hold the government hostage to hide the truth.",
